  "description": "This golden tofu dish comes together in four surprisingly simple steps, partly thanks to some shortcut ingredients. Wait\ntill you try the coconut sauce; it's creamy and umami with a touch of sweetness and zing, and the chewy udon soak it up beautifully.\nDue to recent sourcing\nchallenges, we’ve\nreplaced bamboo shoots\nwith zucchini and red\nonion with brown\nonion, which may be a\nlittle different to what’s\npictured. Don’t worry,\nyour recipe will be just\nas delicious!",
