  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the plant-based butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook ginger paste and garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt. Stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63158dd574431fc09c078f4a/step-29b12594.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cornflour and a pinch of salt and pepper. Add tofu, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63158dd574431fc09c078f4a/step-56904d85.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Shake excess flour off tofu.\n• Cook tofu, stirring, until browned on all sides, 3-4 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63158dd574431fc09c078f4a/step-f335a429.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Stir-fry the onion, carrot and zucchini until tender, 5-6 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63158dd574431fc09c078f4a/step-1737c233.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add Southeast Asian spice blend to the veggies in the pan and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in coconut milk, the water (for the curry), the soy sauce and brown sugar. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Return tofu to pan. Add baby spinach leaves and cook, stirring, until spinach is wilted.\n• Remove from heat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63158dd574431fc09c078f4a/step-184ef364.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Southeast Asian tofu and coconut curry and ginger-garlic rice between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63158dd574431fc09c078f4a/step-575184e3.jpg"
    }
  ]
